Package: zoomriya-agent
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: zoomriya-base, smartmontools, snapper, systemd, openssh-server, openssh-sftp-server, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA OS root helper
 The one root helper ZOOMRIYA OS adds. Box Desktop's server asks it for the
 box's status, its drives' health and its restore points, to restore one,
 to restart, and to move the maintenance hour, when the box restarts by
 itself if an update or a restore waits for it. It turns advanced access
 (SSH for the box's admins, from the home network) on and off, and makes
 the diagnostics bundle for ZOOMRIYA support. It accepts only a fixed
 list of requests and logs each one with who asked.
